        <mxCell id="c174" value="&lt;i&gt;no relationship: the table holds only measures&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="88" y="518" width="220" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c175" value="&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt; the table that holds the key &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;*&lt;/b&gt; the table that refers to it &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Solid&lt;/b&gt; an active relationship &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Dashed&lt;/b&gt; an inactive one" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="600" width="860" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c176" value="&lt;i&gt;The model answer after Exercise 14.2: the sales star (SalesInvoiceLine, Item, Customer) and the ledger star (GLEntry, Account, CostCenter) share the Date table, and ShippedLines, the fact table of Exercise 14.2, relates to Date twice, to Item once. Every filter arrow points from the dimension to the fact table. Each table lists some of its columns, and Key Measures holds 37 measures, four of them shown.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="626" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
